    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Custom Wooden Crating</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For premium or fragile motorcycles, a tailor‑made wooden crate provides the final barrier. The crate is built to the bike’s exact dimensions, with interior bracing that locks the bike in place, eliminating movement inside the container.</p>
  </div>
</div>
